// Footprints of this board.

// Hirose FH34SRJ-40S-0.5SH(50) (drawing EDC-159714-50-04): 40 contacts at 0.5 mm, top and bottom
// contacts (an FPC's contacts may face either way), 1 mm high, a back-flip actuator. Its
// recommended pattern: 0.3 x 0.8 mm leads over B = 19.5 mm, the two fittings 0.4 x 0.8 mm between
// E = 21.1 and F = 21.9 mm, 3.3 mm from the leads' outer edge to the fittings' (centres 2.5 mm
// apart); the FPC enters on the fittings' side (+y here), the leads leave at the back. Contact 1
// at +x, so that with no rotation the FPC's contact 1 at the right meets it.
